---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Who's behind The Songwriter's Desk — a site by working songwriter Dan Healy."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 class="serif text-4xl mb-6">About</h1>

    <p>
      The Songwriter's Desk is a free toolkit and blog for working songwriters — people who
      actually finish songs and try to do something with them.
    </p>

    <p>
      It's hosted by me, Dan Healy. I'm a songwriter. Everything on this site is built
      because I wanted it to exist and couldn't find it elsewhere, or because the
      existing version of it was ugly, slow, or trying to upsell me.
    </p>

    <h2>What's here</h2>
    <p>
      Tools for the writing — a song idea generator, a slant-rhyme finder, a syllable
      and stress analyser, song title generators, chord and structure helpers. And
      tools for the business — a split sheet generator, a royalty split calculator,
      PRO comparisons, and explainers that use plain English.
    </p>

    <h2>Why listen to me</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a working songwriter, not a music journalist or a teacher by trade. I write
      about what I actually run into, not what's trending. When I don't know something,
      I say so. When I've changed my mind, I write about that too.
    </p>

    <h2>Say hi</h2>
    <p>
      Email me at <a href="mailto:hi@songwritersdesk.com">hi@songwritersdesk.com</a>
      or find me on my music channels as Dan Healy.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
